This helper supports PP-OCRv6_small_det and PP-OCRv6_small_rec by
PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR, distributed under Apache-2.0 according to the model cards.
Copyright (c) 2016 PaddlePaddle Authors. All Rights Reserved.
Upstream: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR

Models are deployed separately by cloning the official ONNX repositories:
https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_small_det_onnx
https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_small_rec_onnx
The helper reads inference.onnx and the original inference.yml character
dictionary and preprocessing metadata without modifying either repository.
It performs no download, conversion, training or quantization. There is no
custom model manifest or generated dictionary. The C++ pipeline implements BGR
normalization, DB quad postprocessing and CTC decoding; its floating-point
rectangle expansion differs from the reference's integer pyclipper offset.

ONNX Runtime is distributed with its upstream LICENSE and ThirdPartyNotices.txt
in the sibling onnxruntime license directory. Qt and OpenCV are system libraries,
not bundled here. No Live2D SDK or Python environment is included in this package.
